# The image's build context (#170): only what the game's build reads. Everything else is left out, so a run journal
# (provider bodies), a key, the media, or local state can never reach a build or an image layer.
# tests/deploy/docker-context.test.mjs holds this file to that.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/game/package.json
!apps/game/next.config.mjs
!apps/game/next-env.d.ts
!apps/game/tsconfig.json
!apps/game/src
!packages/*/package.json
!packages/artifact/src
!ops/deploy/entrypoint.sh

# Never in the context, even inside a directory let in above: the last rule that matches a path wins.
**/.git
**/.claude
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/tmp
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/credentials
**/.aws
**/.huggingface
**/.config
**/.cache
**/.venv
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.jsonl*
docs
**/*.gif
**/*.mp4
**/*.webm
**/*.tsbuildinfo
